  "app.about.privacy_note": "A check sends one request for a 200-byte pointer to the project’s edition channel, and up to 29 more for the files of a newer edition; then one request to Expo’s update service for a newer build of this app. Each host sees the network address, the app’s user agent and the time, in its request logs. Nothing identifies the reader; nothing about the reader is stored; no request is made unless you tap, or switch the automatic check on. Every downloaded edition file is checked against its published hash before a single value from it is shown.",
